大体来说，对于extension 流程是First, I constructed data pairs for training the SIDE metric. The training setup used 3,600 training triplets and 400 validation triplets. Each triplet contains code, a good summary, and a bad summary. This allows SIDE to learn which summary is more semantically aligned with the code. This is the same process I used to reproduce the java version

Then I used SIDE to filter the Funcom Python dataset. I set the filtering threshold to 0.9. After filtering, 17,137 out of 200,000 instances were retained, which is about 8.5 percent of the training data. To create a fair comparison, I also sampled an equal number of training examples as the control group without metric SIDE filtering.

Finally, I trained CodeT5 separately on the unfiltered training data and the filtered training data by metric SIDE. Then I generated summaries and evaluated them using standard metrics and an LLM judge. This gives us two conditions: unfiltered data versus filtered training data.

And the llm setting used here is Gpt5.3, with no reasoning mode, and the score range is from 1-5. 然后你仍需结合/scratch/zcheng06/SideJavaPy/SidePython来决定具体的workflow和内容

